        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 21,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-06-22T01:52:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "would it be less efficient if we pass the encoded stream through crc8 and then plug in the 5 LSB  bits of the crc8, encoded, into the stream every so often?\n\nI am just not sure we need another function for this purpose, even though I don\u0027t doubt your ability to come up with a good scheme for crc5 :)",
      "parentUuid": "0bf08d51_25386377",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 21,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 21,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "f870a3eb787ecb5feef3853c4c0472643b7a8839",
